---@field createTime? string Output only. When the job was created.
---@field trainingInput? gcp.ml_v1.GoogleCloudMlV1__TrainingInput Input parameters to create a training job.
---@field startTime? string Output only. When the job processing was started.
---@field endTime? string Output only. When the job processing was completed.
---@field jobId? string Required. The user-specified id of the job.
---@field predictionInput? gcp.ml_v1.GoogleCloudMlV1__PredictionInput Input parameters to create a prediction job.
---@field state? gcp.ml_v1.GoogleCloudMlV1__JobStateEnum|string Output only. The detailed state of a job.
